-19 14:34] Diana**: Yeah, the one that's drifting is a landscape scan.\\n\\n**[2026-08-19 14:39] Charlie**: Got it. The coordinate transform for rotated pages in PDF is notorious. I'll add a check for the `/Rotate` key in the page dictionary.\\n\\n**[2026-08-19 14:41] Bob**: @Charlie do we need to worry about different DPIs between monitors in a multi-head setup?\\n\\n**[2026-08-19 14:44] Charlie**: Hopefully not if we stay in PDF point-space. I'll verify that tomorrow.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src slack 57 slack thread high dpi scale math channel cipherdoc date 2026 08 19 2026 08 19 13 51 charli okay i ve updat the scale math to use the pdf render s intern viewport dimens instead of raw screen pixel and cross check it against the preview overlay coordin from the redact preview work that s where the scale factor error wa show up most 2026 08 19 14 26 diana i m still see a1 2 pixel drift on some document it s better but not perfect 2026 08 19 14 31 charli are those document rotat i might need to check the rotat matrix too 2026 08 19 14 34 diana yeah the one that s drift is a landscap scan 2026 08 19 14 39 charli got it the coordin transform for rotat page in pdf is notori i ll add a check for the rotat key in the page dictionari 2026 08 19 14 41 bob charli do we need to worri about differ dpis between monitor in a multi head setup 2026 08 19 14 44 charli hope not if we stay in pdf point space i ll verifi that tomorrow\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e90874188a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-19-high-dpi-scaling-math.md\", \"id\": \"60108b38a02a0431\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.2575539668884522, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.05677811698350318, \"vector_similarity\": 0.72603095, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_nam